      {
        "id": "strategy_template_prompt",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "nodetool.constant.String",
        "data": {
          "value": "You are a senior movie-poster strategist.  \n\nWrite a creative strategy for a fictional film called **\u201c{{MOVIE_TITLE}}\u201d** (Genre: **{{GENRE}}**, Audience: **{{PRIMARY_AUDIENCE}}**).  \n\nReturn only Markdown with the following sections, no commentary.  \n\n## Goal & Positioning  \n\n1\u20132 lines on what the poster must promise to the audience.  \n\n## Audience Insight  \n\n3\u20135 bullets: emotional drives, visual tastes, cultural touchpoints.  \n\n## Core Visual Concept  \n\nOne bold line: the \u201cbig idea\u201d that excites this audience.  \n\n## Design System  \n\n- **Color Palette** \u2013 up to 5 items: Name + Hex + emotion.  \n\n- **Imagery** \u2013 \u226410 words: hero focus, composition, lighting style.  \n\n- **Typography** \u2013 1\u20132 cues (font family + texture/mood).  \n\n"
        },
