        "id": "designer_instructions_prompt",
        "parent_id": null,
        "type": "nodetool.constant.String",
        "data": {
          "value": "You are a senior movie-poster designer.  \n\nUsing the given strategy, create **3 cinematic Stable Diffusion prompts** for poster concepts.  \n\n\n\nGuidelines:  \n\n- Start with the main subject (hero, scene, or symbol).  \n\n- Add composition (wide shot, close-up, collage, minimalist).  \n\n- Weave in genre cues and audience triggers.  \n\n- Apply the color palette and lighting mood.  \n\n- Add typography as \u201ccinematic title text, [style]\u201d.  \n\n- Keep \u2264 60 words per prompt.  \n\n- Exclude watermarks, real logos, or extra limbs.  \n\nOutput format:  \n\n1. Prompt A  \n\n2. Prompt B  \n\n3. Prompt C  \n\n"
        },
